GAL16V8
ADSCSIU5

IRQ  CS5380 DACK SEL  ZREAD DOE  DMALED U4P13 ST7  GND
SLAVE INT2 IOW  IOR  RDOE U8OE U11OE LATCHCK XRDY VCC

/IOW.T = /DACK * /U4P13 * /U11OE
    + /DACK * /SEL * /ZREAD
    + /CS5380 * /SEL * /ZREAD
IOW.E = VCC

/IOR.T = /DACK * U4P13 * /ST7 * /LATCHCK
    + /CS5380 * /SEL * ZREAD
    + /DACK * /SEL * ZREAD
IOR.E = VCC

/RDOE.T = /SEL * ZREAD * DOE * /LATCHCK
    + /SEL * DOE * /DMALED * /IOR
RDOE.E = VCC

U8OE.T = /CS5380 * /DMALED * /U4P13 * /ST7
    + /CS5380 * ZREAD * /DMALED
    + ZREAD * /DMALED * /IOR
    + ZREAD * /DOE
    + /ZREAD * /U11OE
    + SEL * SLAVE
    + SEL * /DMALED
U8OE.E = VCC

/U11OE.T = /CS5380 * /SEL * /ZREAD * /DMALED * /U4P13 * /ST7
    + /DMALED * /ST7 * /U11OE
    + /DACK * /DMALED * /U4P13 * /ST7
U11OE.E = VCC

/LATCHCK.T = /CS5380 * /SEL * /ZREAD * /DMALED
    + /DACK * /SEL * /DMALED * /ST7
    + /CS5380 * /SEL * /DMALED * /ST7
    + /DACK * /SEL * /ZREAD * /DMALED
    + /DACK * /DMALED * U4P13 * /ST7
LATCHCK.E = VCC

XRDY.T = /DACK * ST7
    + /CS5380
XRDY.E = /SEL * /DMALED

INT2.T = GND
INT2.E = GND

DESCRIPTION

AdSCSI 2000 U5, equivalent equations fitted from the original chip's recorded behaviour (gals/u5). Pin names are the board nets measured on 2026-11-08 (schematic/netlist/gal_nets.csv).
